Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 12:32:36 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat: smart-scale BODY line for the AI coach (not wired)

ScaleCoachContext.line(repo) returns one compact English line, e.g.
'BODY (smart scale, latest 2026-10-15): weight 78.2 kg (-0.6 kg vs 7d,
-1.4 kg vs 30d), body fat 18.1% (-0.3 pp vs 7d), lean mass 61.0 kg, bone
3.1 kg, water 45.2 kg, BMR 1780 kcal', or null when there is no scale data.
Missing figures are omitted, never dashed; an older metric says 'as of'.
Left for AiCoach to call; no upstream file changes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
